WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:01.470
I've worked with Miz Cracker,

00:00:01.470 --> 00:00:03.990
we did her finale look for 'Drag Race.'

00:00:03.990 --> 00:00:08.063
Madonna, I've worked with her
since I was like 22 years old.

00:00:08.063 --> 00:00:12.090
Nicki Minaj, Amanda Lepore, Lady Bunny,

00:00:12.090 --> 00:00:16.740
and another wonderful queen
that I work with is Miss Fame.

00:00:16.740 --> 00:00:19.407
I did a lot of her finale looks.

00:00:26.810 --> 00:00:29.190
We are a custom design studio.

00:00:29.190 --> 00:00:32.657
We pretty much create
anything from stage wear

00:00:32.657 --> 00:00:37.657
to couture, to bridal, to gloves, hats,

00:00:37.674 --> 00:00:40.290
it's pretty much a place
where anything is possible.

00:00:40.290 --> 00:00:42.572
I would say anything from burlesque,

00:00:42.572 --> 00:00:46.087
to special effects, to movies, television,

00:00:46.087 --> 00:00:50.150
high fashion, couture, to anything

00:00:50.150 --> 00:00:51.700
that you could wrap your head around

00:00:51.700 --> 00:00:54.270
and just make fabulous, that's our niche.

00:00:54.270 --> 00:00:56.580
We will use anything
from the most delicate

00:00:56.580 --> 00:01:01.580
lace, to the stiffest
leather or molded plastic.

00:01:01.630 --> 00:01:03.690
All sorts of just like, synthetics,

00:01:03.690 --> 00:01:05.260
because if you're doing burlesque,

00:01:05.260 --> 00:01:06.430
you're going to be dropping

00:01:06.430 --> 00:01:07.750
that thing on the floor nonstop,

00:01:07.750 --> 00:01:09.500
and you better be able to clean it.

00:01:10.977 --> 00:01:13.313
The things that inspire my work,

00:01:13.313 --> 00:01:17.210
the first thing is the person
that I'm designing around.

00:01:17.210 --> 00:01:21.730
I take their essence, and then
I bring in where I come from

00:01:21.730 --> 00:01:23.587
and I get a lot of my inspiration from

00:01:23.587 --> 00:01:28.280
sci-fi, growing up with sci-fi as a kid.

00:01:28.280 --> 00:01:30.190
Nature never gets it wrong,

00:01:30.190 --> 00:01:31.840
which leads me to architecture,

00:01:31.840 --> 00:01:33.960
which is derived from nature.

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:38.090
Fauna, dinosaurs, you name it,

00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:42.053
I can be inspired by the
shape of a light bulb.

00:01:43.720 --> 00:01:47.650
One of my favorite things
are tear away looks.

00:01:47.650 --> 00:01:50.230
My technique is usually to
make the most unexpected

00:01:50.230 --> 00:01:53.040
thing come off, or the
person just pulls one

00:01:53.040 --> 00:01:56.400
little cord, and the entire
thing just peels away

00:01:56.400 --> 00:01:59.220
to a completely other
look that's underneath it.

00:01:59.220 --> 00:02:02.360
This is for a burlesque
performer named Eden Berlin,

00:02:02.360 --> 00:02:03.960
and I just loved it so much because I was

00:02:03.960 --> 00:02:07.040
thinking of some sort of
flora from outer space

00:02:07.040 --> 00:02:10.300
and I really wanted her to reveal herself,

00:02:10.300 --> 00:02:15.110
and slowly spin and just
like be blooming out of

00:02:15.110 --> 00:02:20.110
this insanely gray
thing, and just sparkle.

00:02:20.150 --> 00:02:23.983
And then there's layer after
layer after layer under this.

00:02:28.974 --> 00:02:31.570
One of the most
challenging burlesque looks

00:02:31.570 --> 00:02:34.650
that I've done as of late is Gin Minsky,

00:02:34.650 --> 00:02:36.970
one of my favorite
clients, she wanted to be

00:02:36.970 --> 00:02:39.272
a soft serve ice cream cone that peeled

00:02:39.272 --> 00:02:43.407
out of an actual physical ice cream cone.

00:02:43.407 --> 00:02:47.660
Had a waffle wrap, she comes
out of her waffle wrap,

00:02:47.660 --> 00:02:51.880
she continues to take things
off, amazing the audience

00:02:51.880 --> 00:02:54.570
until she ends up in
nothing but what looks

00:02:54.570 --> 00:02:57.633
like melted pasties and a G string.

00:02:59.210 --> 00:03:02.040
As much as I love to do stage wear

00:03:02.040 --> 00:03:06.210
and insane costumes, I would love to make

00:03:06.210 --> 00:03:08.910
it accessible to everybody out there.

00:03:08.910 --> 00:03:12.280
If you feel like dressing
like a wasp woman,

00:03:12.280 --> 00:03:15.130
or what have you, one day, we're all going

00:03:15.130 --> 00:03:18.350
to be able to dress
however we feel inside.

00:03:18.350 --> 00:03:20.850
That will be my time to shine.

